==Strategy==
Just like in other [[Zombie Outbreaks]], you will want to meatshield as soon as possible so the first set of [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] peons burrow under them. Then, send out any heavy hitters or [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] to start finishing them off. Once you start to push towards the enemy base, you can spawn [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cats]] or [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien units]] to help deal with the Shibaliens.

